@startuml
title P2 Acceptance - Rollout, Rollback, and Beta Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "Acceptance foundation" as Foundation
participant "Coordinator DB" as DB
participant "Coordinator" as Coord
participant "Windows/macOS nodes" as Nodes
participant "Internal test orbit" as Internal
participant "Real beta Air" as BetaAir
participant "Operators" as Ops

Foundation -> DB : Freeze migration fixture set\nand evidence contract
Foundation -> Ops : Freeze matrix, beta rubric,\nartifact storage rules

Ops -> DB : Apply additive DB migration
Ops -> Coord : Deploy coordinator in\naccept-but-don't-send mode
Coord -> Coord : Read unknown phase-two rows\nwithout emitting new commands

Ops -> Nodes : Roll out capability-aware builds
Nodes --> Coord : register capabilities\nstreamed_tracks / air_rooms / ...

Ops -> Internal : Enable feature flags on\ninternal orbit only
Coord -> Nodes : phase-two commands under flags
Nodes --> Coord : metrics, receipts,\nstream readiness, rights state

Ops -> Internal : Run B1-B7 and 20.5 matrix
Internal --> Ops : platform, load,\nrollback, compatibility evidence

Ops -> Coord : Rehearse rollback
Coord -> DB : leave phase-two rows intact
Ops -> Coord : Disable phase-two flags / downgrade coordinator
Coord --> Ops : legacy pairwise service stays green

Ops -> BetaAir : Enable phased beta rollout
BetaAir --> Ops : seven days of incidents,\nquota telemetry, start/skew/seek trends
Ops -> Ops : calibrate storage + egress quotas\nfrom real telemetry

Ops -> Coord : review telemetry and incidents
Ops -> Ops : publish promotion packet\nor record exact remaining blockers

@enduml
